```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> requested: hotkey / CLI / mobile tap

    requested --> policy_check: emit .requested
    policy_check --> vetoed: CEL rule blocks
    vetoed --> [*]: emit .policy_vetoed

    policy_check --> permission: allow
    permission --> denied: user denies OS prompt
    denied --> [*]: emit .permission_denied

    permission --> recording: granted
    recording --> recording: indicator displayed,<br/>frames flowing
    recording --> paused: user pauses
    paused --> recording: user resumes

    recording --> capture_failed: device unplug,<br/>codec error,<br/>permission revoked
    capture_failed --> stopping: emit .capture_failed
    paused --> stopping: user stops
    recording --> stopping: user stops / auto-detect ends /<br/>max_duration / shutdown

    stopping --> stopped: emit .stopped
    stopped --> enqueued: hand to audio.transcribe / video.full
    enqueued --> indexed: pipeline completes
    indexed --> [*]: KnowledgeObject created<br/>emit .transcript_ready

    enqueued --> pipeline_failed: pipeline errored
    pipeline_failed --> [*]: emit .transcript_failed<br/>(media still on disk for retry)
```
